  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The objective of this IDIQ is to provide USAIDs Office of Transition Initiatives (OTI) with the means to support U.S. foreign policy objectives by catalyzing local initiatives to advance stability, peace and democracy in response to complex political crises. USAID/OTIs program team, comprised of USAID/OTI and Contractor personnel, will work on the ground to seize emerging windows of opportunity to provide adaptive and agile programming.</narrative>
  </description>
